            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Historical Background</strong><br>\nThe Israel-Palestine conflict has its roots in the late 1800s and early 1900s, when Jewish settlers began moving into the area then controlled by the Ottoman Empire and later by the British, known as Palestine. After World War II and the Holocaust, support for a Jewish state grew, and in 1947 the UN passed a resolution to partition Palestine into a Jewish and an Arab state. The subsequent war of 1948 led to the founding of the State of Israel.</p>\n\n<p><strong>US Support for Israel</strong><br>\nThe USA has supported Israel since its founding. This support includes military aid, economic assistance, and diplomatic backing in international forums. The USA views Israel as a strategic ally in the Middle East, representing Western interests in an unstable region. The support is also due to the strong Jewish lobby in the USA and shared democratic values.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Criticism of US Support for Israel</strong><br>\nThere is criticism of the way the USA supports Israel, especially regarding the conflict with the Palestinians. Critics argue that the extensive military support from the USA exacerbates the conflict and reduces the prospects for a peaceful resolution. They also point out human rights violations by Israeli forces.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
