              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>The Role of the USA as a Mediator</strong><br>\nThe USA has often tried to act as a mediator in the Israel-Palestine conflict. They have launched several peace initiatives and supported negotiations between the two sides. However, these efforts have often had little success, partly because of the distrust some Palestinians and other Arabs have towards the USA as an impartial mediator.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Oslo Accords</strong><br>\nUnder US mediation, Israel and the PLO came to the Oslo Accords in 1993, which provided for Palestinian self-rule and initiated a peace process. Although these accords were seen as a step in the right direction, many of the core issues of the conflict have remained unresolved.</p>\n\n<p><strong>US Reaction to Hamas</strong><br>\nThe USA considers Hamas, a Palestinian political and military organization, as a terrorist group. Their relationship with Hamas complicates US mediation efforts, as Hamas plays a significant role in Palestinian politics.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
